            <div class="box-title">Scenario</div>
            A remote body controller ECU that requested two profiles on our ECU (door lock control and window control) experiences a reset. SPM detects the heartbeat loss, removes the faulted requester from both profiles, reports the loss-of-node DTC, and keeps the ECU awake via SpmStayAwakeTimer to allow the body controller to recover and re-request.
        </div>
