  <rect x="16" y="11" width="26" height="26" rx="13" fill="#3b82f6"/>
  <text x="29" y="29" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">1</text>
  <text x="52" y="22" font-size="11" font-weight="700" fill="#1e40af">Application calls SPM_ActivateProfile(applIntfID=42)</text>
  <text x="52" y="38" font-size="10" fill="#2d3436">SPM matches applIntfID=42 &rarr; ADAS_FrontCam profile (from SpmApplIntfID in YAML)</text>
  <line x1="310" y1="49" x2="310" y2="63" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#rt_arr)"/>

  <rect x="10" y="63" width="600" height="44" rx="8" fill="#eefff4" stroke="#27ae60" stroke-width="1.5"/>
  <rect x="16" y="69" width="26" height="26" rx="13" fill="#27ae60"/>
  <text x="29" y="87" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">2</text>
  <text x="52" y="80" font-size="11" font-weight="700" fill="#065f46">Check priority: SpmVehDefActPriorON = SPM_PRF_AP_HIGH</text>
  <text x="52" y="96" font-size="10" fill="#2d3436">Energy optimizer threshold is MEDIUM &rarr; HIGH &gt; MEDIUM &rarr; activation allowed</text>
  <line x1="310" y1="107" x2="310" y2="121" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#rt_arr)"/>

  <rect x="10" y="121" width="600" height="44" rx="8" fill="#eefff4" stroke="#27ae60" stroke-width="1.5"/>
  <rect x="16" y="127" width="26" height="26" rx="13" fill="#27ae60"/>
  <text x="29" y="145" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">3</text>
  <text x="52" y="138" font-size="11" font-weight="700" fill="#065f46">Resolve dependency: SpmProfDepType = ACT_AND_CONS &rarr; RemoteCam_Profile</text>
  <text x="52" y="154" font-size="10" fill="#2d3436">SPM looks up target device for RemoteCam &rarr; FrontCamera (192.168.1.50)</text>
  <line x1="310" y1="165" x2="310" y2="179" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#rt_arr)"/>

  <rect x="10" y="179" width="600" height="44" rx="8" fill="#fff8e6" stroke="#f39c12" stroke-width="1.5"/>
  <rect x="16" y="185" width="26" height="26" rx="13" fill="#f39c12"/>
  <text x="29" y="203" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">4</text>
  <text x="52" y="196" font-size="11" font-weight="700" fill="#92400e">Execute WkUpSeq_Camera: TC10 port 3 (50ms) &rarr; ETH WUF A bit 5</text>
  <text x="52" y="212" font-size="10" fill="#2d3436">Step delays from SpmSeqStepDly, commands from SpmCommandType/Value in YAML</text>
  <line x1="310" y1="223" x2="310" y2="237" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#rt_arr)"/>

  <rect x="10" y="237" width="600" height="44" rx="8" fill="#eefff4" stroke="#27ae60" stroke-width="1.5"/>
  <rect x="16" y="243" width="26" height="26" rx="13" fill="#27ae60"/>
  <text x="29" y="261" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">5</text>
  <text x="52" y="254" font-size="11" font-weight="700" fill="#065f46">Monitor heartbeat: timeout = 3000ms (SpmTrgDvcDtcTimeOut)</text>
  <text x="52" y="270" font-size="10" fill="#2d3436">Camera ECU boots, sends HB within 3s &rarr; device confirmed alive</text>
  <line x1="310" y1="281" x2="310" y2="295" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#rt_arr)"/>

  <rect x="10" y="295" width="600" height="44" rx="8" fill="#dbeafe" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="1.5"/>
  <rect x="16" y="301" width="26" height="26" rx="13" fill="#3b82f6"/>
  <text x="29" y="319" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#fff">6</text>
  <text x="52" y="312" font-size="11" font-weight="700" fill="#1e40af">Profile ADAS_FrontCam &rarr; Activated. DID 0xE0DD bit 7 = 1</text>
  <text x="52" y="328" font-size="10" fill="#2d3436">PDU groups enabled (SpmComIPduGroupEvnt), DID bitmap updated (SpmProfBitMapIndex=7)</text>
  <rect x="60" y="348" width="500" height="20" rx="6" fill="#f3e8ff" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text x="310" y="362" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" font-weight="600" fill="#6d28d9">Every value in this flow traces back to a YAML-defined parameter</text>
</svg>

</div>
</details>

<!-- 7.9 Validation -->
<details>
<summary><strong>7.9 &nbsp; Validation Rules (<code>Sum_Spm.chk</code>)</strong></summary>
<div class="details-content">

<p>The <code>.chk</code> validation file enforces consistency rules on the YAML-derived configuration at generation time:</p>

<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Rule</th><th>YAML Parameters Involved</th><th>Error If Violated</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>GPIO commands require helper function</td><td><code>SpmCommandType = SEND_BOARD_LV_WKUP_GPIO</code> + <code>SpmWkUpHelperFunction</code></td><td>"GPIO wake-up command used but SpmWkUpHelperFunction not configured"</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Edge nodes cannot use CAN commands</td><td><code>SpmNodeType = SPM_NODE_EDGE</code> + <code>SpmCommandType = SEND_CAN_*</code></td><td>"CAN wake-up command not supported on edge nodes"</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Step delays must be set</td><td><code>SpmSeqStepDly</code></td><td>"Wake-up step delay not configured"</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Unique profile bit indices</td><td><code>SpmProfBitMapIndex</code></td><td>"Duplicate bitmap index detected"</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Dependency target must exist</td><td><code>SpmProfRef</code></td><td>"Referenced profile not found in configuration"</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Always run <code>Sum_Spm_Validate.oaw</code> after editing YAML to catch configuration errors before code generation.</p>

</div>
</details>

<hr>

<!-- Section 8 -->
<h2 id="section-8">8. Configuration System</h2>

<h3>Key Configuration Containers</h3>

<pre><code>Spm (root)
 +-- SpmConfigSet
 |    +-- SpmConfPowPrf[]          -- Power Profile definitions
 |    |    +-- SpmSrvcAndInstID    -- Service ID + Instance ID
 |    |    +-- SpmProfNumber       -- Profile number
 |    |    +-- SpmProfileIsLocal   -- Local or remote
 |    |    +-- SpmApplIntfID       -- Application Interface ID
 |    |    +-- SpmLocActivationAllowed
 |    |    +-- SpmVehDefActPriorON/OFF
 |    |    +-- SpmProfBitMapIndex  -- DID E0DD bit position
 |    |    +-- SpmComIPduGroupEvnt_Tx/Rx  -- PDU group refs
 |    |    +-- SpmProfileSwDeps[]  -- Dependencies
 |    |         +-- SpmProfDepType
 |    |         +-- SpmPrfRef
 |    |
 |    +-- SpmPgttEntries           -- Power Graph Traversal Table
 |         +-- SpmTrgDvc[]         -- Target Devices
 |         +-- SpmWkngDvc          -- Waking Device (this ECU)
 |         +-- SpmWkUpSeq[]        -- Wakeup Sequences
 |
 +-- SpmGeneral
      +-- SpmDiagnostic            -- DID configuration
      +-- SpmMainFunctionPeriodicity
      +-- SpmPermitExecutionMask
      +-- SpmWkUpHelperFunction
      +-- SpmCANWkUpFrmRef         -- CAN WUF Tx/Rx PDU refs
      +-- SpmGenerateInitRunnable
      +-- SpmActDeactRetryPeriodicity
      +-- SpmLowVoltagePowerInfo
      +-- SpmVLANCom               -- VLAN communication setup</code></pre>

<h3>Calibratable Parameters (Runtime)</h3>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Default</th><th>Range</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>HB Burst Periodicity</td><td>5 ms</td><td>5-65535</td><td>Initial rapid heartbeat rate</td></tr>
    <tr><td>HB Steady Periodicity</td><td>1000 ms</td><td>5-65535</td><td>Normal heartbeat rate</td></tr>
    <tr><td>HB Shutdown Delay</td><td>2000 ms</td><td>0-65000</td><td>Wait after last burst HB before shutdown</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Own WakeUp Frame</td><td>A</td><td>A/B/C</td><td>Which WUF contains this ECU's bit</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Own WakeUp Bit</td><td>0</td><td>0-63</td><td>Bit position in own WUF</td></tr>
    <tr><td>SM Frame Queue Length</td><td>targets x profiles</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Max queued SM Rx messages</td></tr>
    <tr><td>HB Queue Length</td><td>targets</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Max queued HB Rx messages</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<hr>

<!-- Section 9 -->
<h2 id="section-9">9. External Interfaces</h2>

<h3>Client/Server APIs (Provided by SPM)</h3>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>API</th><th>Signature</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><code>SPM_ActivateProfile</code></td><td><code>Std_ReturnType (uint16 ApplicationInterfaceID)</code></td><td>Request profile activation</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>SPM_DeactivateProfile</code></td><td><code>Std_ReturnType (uint16 ApplicationInterfaceID)</code></td><td>Request profile deactivation</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>SPM_GetProfileState</code></td><td><code>Std_ReturnType (uint16 AppIntfID, uint8* ProfileState)</code></td><td>Query profile state</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>SPM_GetProfileActivationPermission</code></td><td><code>Std_ReturnType (uint16 AppIntfID, boolean* Permission)</code></td><td>Check if activation is allowed</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>SPM_ActivityRecordCmd</code></td><td><code>void (uint8 Cmd)</code></td><td>Start/Stop/Reset activity recording</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>SPM_GetDTCIdentifier</code></td><td><code>void (uint32 ipAddr, uint16* dtcCode)</code></td><td>Get DTC code for a target IP</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>Runnable_SPM_SdLearningStatusIndication</code></td><td><code>void (uint8 learningStatus)</code></td><td>SD learning session notification</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h3>Sender/Receiver Interfaces</h3>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Interface</th><th>Direction</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><code>SUSD_PermitExecution</code></td><td>SUSD &rarr; SPM</td><td>Permit execution bitmask</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>SPM_ShutdownPermission</code></td><td>SPM &rarr; SUSD</td><td>Shutdown readiness (rolling counter or 0xFF/0xFE)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>SPM_ServiceActivationStatusNotification</code></td><td>SPM &rarr; SSFM</td><td>Active services list + DTC allowed flags</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>SPM_LossOfNodeIndication</code></td><td>SPM &rarr; SSFM</td><td>Node DTC code + LOST/RECOVERED status</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>sftpwrmgr_Gen</code> (per VLAN)</td><td>SPM &harr; Com</td><td>SM frame Tx/Rx</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>sftpwrmgr_heartbeat_Gen</code> (per VLAN)</td><td>SPM &harr; Com</td><td>PM heartbeat Tx/Rx</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>SR_SPM_ETHWakeUpFrame</code> (per VLAN)</td><td>SPM &harr; Com</td><td>Ethernet WUF Tx/Rx</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

