              <div class="pd-param"><span class="pn">Sum_Ssfm_Errh_F094_LocalSupWdgMStsSOH</span><span class="type-badge type-int">INT</span><span class="pm">0..1</span><span class="pr">0&ndash;65535</span><span class="pdef">1</span><span class="pdesc">SUM_ERRH_SOHSupFail_Thresh_Init=1, TW=10. Ref to DcmDspDid for DID 0xF094.</span></div>
