                  <div class="pd-ref"><span class="pn">Did_E0D7_Reference</span><span class="type-badge type-ref">REF</span><span class="pm">1..1</span><span class="pr">Dcm &rarr; DcmDspDid</span><span class="pdesc">DID 0xE0D7 Wakeup/Off Power Mode Activity Records.</span></div>
                  <div class="pd-ref"><span class="pn">Did_F088_Reference</span><span class="type-badge type-ref">REF</span><span class="pm">1..1</span><span class="pr">Dcm &rarr; DcmDspDid</span><span class="pdesc">DID 0xF088 Control Module Input Voltage.</span></div>
                  <div class="pd-ref"><span class="pn">Did_F089_Reference</span><span class="type-badge type-ref">REF</span><span class="pm">1..1</span><span class="pr">Dcm &rarr; DcmDspDid</span><span class="pdesc">DID 0xF089 Application Shutdown Prohibit.</span></div>
